---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'November 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — StreamFetch"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the use of StreamFetch for personal media downloading and educational archiving."
  canonicalUrl="https://streamfetch.app/terms"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 w-full">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-10 text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] text-[#171717] mb-3 shadow-xs">
        <span class="mono-eyebrow text-[11px] text-[#4d4d4d]">Legal Agreement</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="heading-lg text-[#171717] mb-2">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-[#8f8f8f]">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated} • Please read carefully before using this utility
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content Sections -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing and using StreamFetch ("the Service"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, you must discontinue use of the Service immediately.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">2. Scope & Permitted Use</h2>
        <p>
          StreamFetch is provided exclusively as a technical tool for personal archiving, educational study, private backup, and downloading content that you own, that is in the public domain, or that is distributed under permissive licenses (such as Creative Commons).
        </p>
        <p>
          You agree not to use the Service for:
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-xs text-[#4d4d4d]">
          <li>Infringing upon any third party's copyright, trademark, patent, or intellectual property rights.</li>
          <li>Commercial redistribution, resale, or broadcasting of downloaded materials without explicit written authorization from the copyright holder.</li>
          <li>Bypassing Digital Rights Management (DRM) mechanisms, encryption, or password-protected content.</li>
          <li>Conducting automated scraping, Denial of Service (DoS/DDoS) attacks, or excessive bulk queries that interfere with server stability.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">3. Intellectual Property Rights & Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          StreamFetch does not host, index, or store video or audio files. All content processed through the Service remains the exclusive property of its respective creators, copyright owners, and platforms. We claim no ownership, endorsement, or rights to any media processed through the application.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">4. User Responsibility & Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You are solely responsible for verifying the legal status of any media you download and ensuring your use complies with the applicable laws of your country, state, and local jurisdiction. You agree to indemnify and hold harmless StreamFetch and its maintainers from any claims, damages, liabilities, or expenses arising from your misuse of the Service or violation of these Terms.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">5. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. StreamFetch does not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted, error-free, secure, or that any specific YouTube video stream will always be available or downloadable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          Under no circumstances shall StreamFetch or its developers be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, special, or exemplary damages arising out of your access to, use of, or inability to use the Service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-[#ebebeb] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717]">7. Modifications to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to amend these Terms of Service at any time. Any changes will be posted directly to this page with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

